%% Structure unchanged from original 025c2f0 baseline.
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Inbox UI
  participant API as Fastify API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  UI->>API: POST approve (version, title?, dueAt?)
  Note over API: requireUser: session + Origin/CSRF, then parse ID/body
  API->>DB: BEGIN; lock user FOR UPDATE
  API->>DB: SELECT suggestion by id + user_id FOR UPDATE
  Note over API,DB: Missing user or owned suggestion rolls back (401/404)
  alt Already Approved
    API->>DB: SELECT existing owned task; serializeTask
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: Existing task; invalidate private queries
  else Not Proposed or version mismatch
    API->>DB: ROLLBACK
    API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
  else Valid Proposed
    API->>DB: UPDATE suggestion Approved, title, dueAt, version + 1
    API->>DB: INSERT task with same user and source IDs
    API->>DB: serializeTask; COMMIT
    API-->>UI: New task; invalidate private queries
  end
  Note over UI,API: Calendar creation requires a separate confirmation and request
